<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ExitFlow | Serah Terima</title>
    @vite(['resources/css/app.css', 'resources/js/app.js'])
</head>
<body>
<div class="app-shell">
    <aside class="sidebar" data-sidebar>
        <div class="brand"><span class="brand-mark">ef</span><span>exit<span>flow</span></span><button class="close-menu" data-sidebar-close>×</button></div>
        <div class="workspace"><span class="workspace-dot"></span><span><small>WORKSPACE</small><strong>Operasional</strong></span><b>⌄</b></div>
        <nav><p class="nav-label">Menu utama</p><a class="nav-link active" href="#overview">◈ <span>Ringkasan</span></a><a class="nav-link" href="#forms">▤ <span>Form serah-terima</span><b>12</b></a><a class="nav-link" href="#employees">♙ <span>Pegawai</span></a><a class="nav-link" href="#assets">▣ <span>Inventaris</span></a><p class="nav-label second">Workspace</p><a class="nav-link" href="#reports">◒ <span>Laporan</span></a><a class="nav-link" href="#settings">⚙ <span>Pengaturan</span></a></nav>
        <div class="sidebar-footer"><div class="help-card"><i>?</i><span><strong>Butuh bantuan?</strong><small>Buka panduan penggunaan</small></span>›</div><div class="profile"><span class="avatar">AR</span><span><strong>Andi Rahman</strong><small>Administrator</small></span><b>•••</b></div></div>
    </aside>
    <main class="main-content">
        <header class="topbar"><button class="menu-button" data-sidebar-open>☰</button><div class="breadcrumb"><span>Workspace</span><b>/</b><strong>Ringkasan</strong></div><div class="top-actions"><button class="notification">♧<i></i></button><span class="top-avatar">AR</span></div></header>
        <div class="page-wrap" id="overview">
            <section class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Kamis, 24 September 2026</p><h1>Selamat pagi, Andi <span>✦</span></h1><p class="heading-copy">Pantau seluruh proses serah-terima dan selesaikan pekerjaan hari ini.</p></div><button class="primary-button" data-open-form>＋ Buat form baru</button></section>
            <section class="stat-grid"><article class="stat-card"><div class="stat-top"><span>Total form</span><i class="stat-symbol coral">▤</i></div><strong>128</strong><small class="up">↑ 12,5% <em>vs bulan lalu</em></small></article><article class="stat-card"><div class="stat-top"><span>Menunggu persetujuan</span><i class="stat-symbol amber">◷</i></div><strong>12</strong><small class="neutral">3 perlu ditinjau hari ini</small></article><article class="stat-card"><div class="stat-top"><span>Selesai bulan ini</span><i class="stat-symbol teal">✓</i></div><strong>84</strong><small class="up">↑ 8,2% <em>vs bulan lalu</em></small></article><article class="stat-card"><div class="stat-top"><span>Aset belum kembali</span><i class="stat-symbol plum">▣</i></div><strong>7</strong><small class="down">↓ 2 item <em>sejak minggu lalu</em></small></article></section>
            <section class="content-grid">
                <article class="panel forms-panel" id="forms"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>Form terbaru</h2><p>Daftar serah-terima yang perlu perhatian.</p></div><a href="#forms">Lihat semua →</a></div><div class="table-tools"><label class="search-box">⌕<input type="search" placeholder="Cari nama atau nomor form" data-form-search></label><button class="filter-button">☷ <span>Filter</span></button></div><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Nomor form</th><th>Pegawai</th><th>Departemen</th><th>Tanggal</th><th>Status</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody data-form-list><tr><td><strong>ST-2026-0098</strong></td><td><span class="person"><i class="mini-avatar coral-bg">DN</i>Dimas Nugraha</span></td><td>Engineering</td><td>24 Sep 2026</td><td><span class="status pending">Menunggu</span></td><td>•••</td></tr><tr><td><strong>ST-2026-0097</strong></td><td><span class="person"><i class="mini-avatar blue-bg">SP</i>Sari Puspita</span></td><td>Marketing</td><td>23 Sep 2026</td><td><span class="status approved">Disetujui</span></td><td>•••</td></tr><tr><td><strong>ST-2026-0096</strong></td><td><span class="person"><i class="mini-avatar green-bg">RW</i>Raka Wijaya</span></td><td>Finance</td><td>22 Sep 2026</td><td><span class="status done">Selesai</span></td><td>•••</td></tr><tr><td><strong>ST-2026-0095</strong></td><td><span class="person"><i class="mini-avatar yellow-bg">AL</i>Amelia Lestari</span></td><td>People Ops</td><td>21 Sep 2026</td><td><span class="status rejected">Perlu revisi</span></td><td>•••</td></tr></tbody></table></div></article>
                <article class="panel activity-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>Aktivitas terbaru</h2><p>Jejak perubahan pada workspace.</p></div><button class="dots-button">•••</button></div><div class="activity-list"><div class="activity-item"><i class="activity-icon teal">✓</i><span><strong>Sari Puspita</strong> menyetujui form <b>ST-2026-0097</b><small>18 menit lalu</small></span></div><div class="activity-item"><i class="activity-icon coral">＋</i><span><strong>Andi Rahman</strong> membuat form baru untuk <b>Dimas Nugraha</b><small>42 menit lalu</small></span></div><div class="activity-item"><i class="activity-icon amber">↗</i><span><strong>Raka Wijaya</strong> menambahkan 3 aset ke form<small>1 jam lalu</small></span></div><div class="activity-item"><i class="activity-icon plum">!</i><span><strong>Amelia Lestari</strong> mengirim form untuk revisi<small>3 jam lalu</small></span></div></div><a class="activity-link" href="#activity">Lihat semua aktivitas →</a></article>
            </section>
        </div>
    </main>
</div>
<div class="modal" data-form-modal><div class="modal-card"><div class="modal-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">FORM SERAH-TERIMA</p><h2>Buat form baru</h2></div><button class="close-button" data-close-form>×</button></div><form><label>Nama pegawai<input required placeholder="Cari nama pegawai"></label><div class="form-row"><label>Nomor pegawai<input placeholder="EMP-0000"></label><label>Departemen<select><option>Pilih departemen</option><option>Engineering</option><option>Marketing</option><option>Finance</option></select></label></div><div class="form-row"><label>Tanggal serah-terima<input type="date" value="2026-09-24"></label><label>Alasan keluar<select><option>Pilih alasan</option><option>Resign</option><option>Kontrak selesai</option><option>Mutasi</option></select></label></div><label>Catatan<textarea rows="3" placeholder="Tambahkan catatan bila diperlukan"></textarea></label><div class="modal-actions"><button class="secondary-button" type="button" data-close-form>Batal</button><button class="primary-button" type="submit">Simpan sebagai draft</button></div></form></div></div>
</body>
</html>
